in extends with dprint config update (#1464)\r\n* feat: let plugins say whether they format a range (#1422)\r\n* feat: add permissions to `dprint lsp` to prevent editor from downloading from untrusted sources and to prevent running process plugins without approval (#1408)\r\n* feat: publish a signed packslip with each release (#1407)\r\n* feat(BREAKING): restrict process plugins override config (#1397, #1457)\r\n* fix: only allow npm package names that npm allows (#1402)\r\n* fix: explain a missing dynamic loader when a process plugin fails to start (#1403)\r\n* fix: report a wasm plugin running out of stack as an error for the file, and give wasm 8 MiB of stack (#1463)\r\n* fix: respect `.git/info/exclude` in a linked git worktree and a submodule (#1462)\r\n\r\n## Install\r\n\r\nRun `dprint upgrade` or see https://dprint.dev/install/\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\nThese artifacts have [build provenance attestations](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/security-for-github-actions/using-artifact-attestations/using-artifact-attestations-to-establish-provenance-for-builds).\r\nVerify a download with the [GitHub CLI](https://cli.github.com/):\r\n\r\n```shell\r\ngh attestation verify dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip --repo dprint/dprint\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe zips are also described by a signed [packslip](https://packslip.dev) (`packslip.sigstore.json`):\r\n\r\n```shell\r\npackslip verify packslip.sigstore.json --artifact dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Checksums\r\n\r\n|Artifact|SHA-256 Checksum|\r\n|:--|:--|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-apple-darwin.zip|b94e2ede59904f34f8047ee9f069767acf19df389b3983f4b97a4fd64f5fcf15|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-apple-darwin.zip|5e57a5e75f5d29d1f9dcc10255fccb9815031f4720fe6759643d0ee12cf201f2|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip|83bc6c5df42d6001062a71ac475ceb5be119472af6afb3fce52ff13ed042db77|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc-installer.exe|afd9750f7fcce375f8e26618a9ec7aff8bbcb6206f934763ea957510d355f2de|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-pc-windows-m